DATA NOTICE: xlqc

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  example.tar.gz -> example/ (basis sets, basis_*.dat, geom.xyz)

What:
  Gaussian basis-set definitions (STO-3G, 6-311+G(2d,p), def-TZVP) and
  the molecule geometry for the Hartree-Fock example.

Source:
  https://github.com/recoli/XLQC, example/: 8 of 11 files byte-identical
  at upstream commit ab9170930064 (checked 2026-11-19).
  basis_C.dat and basis_N.dat have differed from upstream since
  HeCBench added the data (2021); geom.xyz was updated in
  ORNL/HeCBench pull request #298 (2026-07-28).

